$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Lugaine" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	 "\n<f1>Map by: <f0> Kore the 50th  <f1>Mission Name: <f0> Dropships" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other from their dropships.  The battle is long and fierce as new forces keep pouring from the ships.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base, touch it to their own flag to capture it.  The first team with 5 captures shall be the victor!";